  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Newton Fund for capacity building in data intensive science in the Middle-East</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Newton Fund builds research and innovation partnerships with developing countries across the world to promote the economic development and social welfare of the partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and skills development programme in big data and data intensive science. It will enable Jordanian researchers to apply advanced techniques to solve development challenges, addresses SDGs 3,11, benefits Middle East countries.</narrative>
  </description>
